{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-19-1","title":"Proverbs 19:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>22; 12:26; 15:16; 16:8; 28:6; Ps 37:26; Mt 16:26; Jas 2:5,6 perverse. 1Sa 25:17,25; Isa 59:3; Mt 12:31-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-2","title":"Proverbs 19:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>that the. 10:21; Ec 12:9; Isa 27:11; Ho 4:6; Joh 16:3; Ro 10:2; Php 1:9 and. 1:16; 14:29; 21:5; 25:8; 28:22; Job 31:5; Ec 7:9; Isa 28:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-3","title":"Proverbs 19:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>foolishness. Ge 3:6-12; 4:5-14; Nu 16:19-41; 17:12,13; 1Sa 13:13; 15:23 1Sa 22:13-23; 1Ki 20:42,43; 2Ki 3:9,10; 6:33; 2Ch 16:9,10 Ac 13:45,46 fretteth. Ps 37:1,7; Isa 8:21,22; Re 16:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-4","title":"Proverbs 19:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>maketh. 6,7; 14:20; Lu 15:13-15 the poor. 10:15; Job 6:15-23; 19:13-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-5","title":"Proverbs 19:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>false. 9; 6:19; 21:28; Ex 23:1; De 19:16-21; Ps 120:3,4; Da 6:24 unpunished. Heb. held innocent. De 5:11; 1Ki 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-6","title":"Proverbs 19:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>will. 12; 16:15; 29:26; Ge 42:6; 2Sa 19:19-39; Job 29:24,25; Ps 45:12 Mt 2:11 and. 17:8; 18:16; 21:14; Ge 32:20; 43:15; Ro 6:23 him that giveth gifts. Heb. a man of gifts.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-7","title":"Proverbs 19:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the brethren. 4; 14:20; Ps 38:11; 88:8,18; Ec 9:15,16; Jas 2:6 he. 21:13; Lu 18:38-40 yet. 18:23; Jas 2:15,16; 1Jo 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-8","title":"Proverbs 19:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>wisdom. Heb. an heart. 17:16; Eze 36:26 loveth. 8:35,36; Joh 12:25; 1Pe 3:10 he that keepeth. 2:1-9; 3:18,21; 4:4,6,21; 16:20; 22:18; Ps 19:11; Joh 14:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-9","title":"Proverbs 19:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>false. 5 and. Isa 9:15-17; Jer 23:25-32; 28:15-17; 29:31,32; Eze 13:22 2Th 2:8-10; 1Ti 4:1,2; 2Pe 2:1-3; Re 19:20; 21:8; 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-10","title":"Proverbs 19:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Delight. 30:21,22; 1Sa 25:36; Es 3:15; Isa 5:11,12; 22:12-14; Ho 7:3-5; 9:1 Am 6:3-6; Lu 16:19,23; Jas 4:9 much. 2Sa 3:24,25,39; Ec 10:5-7; Isa 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-11","title":"Proverbs 19:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>discretion. or, prudence. deferreth. 12:16; 14:29; 15:18; 16:32; 17:14; Col 3:12,13; Jas 1:19 and. 16:32; 20:3; 25:21; Ge 50:15-21; Mt 5:44,45; 18:21,22; Ro 12:18-21 Eph 4:32; 5:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-12","title":"Proverbs 19:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>king's. 16:14,15; 20:2; 28:15; Es 7:8; Ec 8:4; Da 2:12,13; 3:19-23; 5:19 Da 6:24; Lu 12:4,5 his. 2Sa 23:4; Ps 72:6; Ho 14:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-13","title":"Proverbs 19:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>foolish. 10:1; 15:20; 17:21,25; 2Sa 13:1-18:33; Ec 2:18,19 the contentions. 21:9,19; 25:24; 27:15; Job 14:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-14","title":"Proverbs 19:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the inheritance. 13:22; De 21:16; Jos 11:23; 2Co 12:14 and a. 3:6; 18:22; 31:10-31; Ge 24:7; 28:1-4; Jas 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-15","title":"Proverbs 19:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>casteth. 24; 6:9,10; 20:13; 23:21; 24:33; Isa 56:10; Ro 13:11,12; Eph 5:14 and. 10:4,5; 20:13; 23:21; 2Th 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-16","title":"Proverbs 19:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>keepeth the. 3:1; 29:18; Ps 103:18; Ec 8:5; 12:13; Jer 7:23; Lu 10:28; 11:28 Joh 14:15,21-23; 15:10-14; 1Co 7:19; 1Jo 2:3,4; 3:22; 5:3; Re 22:14 keepeth his. 16:17; 21:23; 22:5; Eze 33:5; Mt 16:26 he that despiseth. 13:13; 15:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-17","title":"Proverbs 19:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>that hath. 14:21; 28:8,27; 2Sa 12:6; Ec 11:1 lendeth. 11:24,25; 28:27; De 15:7-14; Isa 58:7-11; Mt 10:41,42; 25:40 2Co 9:6-8; Php 4:17; Heb 6:10 that which he hath given. or, his deed.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-18","title":"Proverbs 19:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Chasten. 13:24; 22:15; 23:13,14; 29:15,17; Heb 12:7-10 for his crying. or, to his destruction, or, to cause him todie.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-19","title":"Proverbs 19:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>man. 22:24,25; 25:28; 29:22; 1Sa 20:30,31; 22:7-23; 24:17-22; 26:21-25 2Sa 16:5,6 do it again. Heb. add.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-20","title":"Proverbs 19:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>receive. 1:8; 2:1-9; 8:34,35 be. Nu 23:10; De 8:16; 32:29; Ps 37:37; 90:12,14; Lu 16:19-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-21","title":"Proverbs 19:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>many. 12:2; Ge 37:19,20; Es 9:25; Ps 21:11; 33:10,11; 83:4; Ec 7:29 Isa 7:6,7; Da 11:24,25; Mt 26:4,5; 27:63,64 nevertheless. 16:1,9; 21:1,30; Ge 45:4-8; 50:20; Job 23:13; Isa 14:24,26,27 Isa 46:10; Da 4:35; Ac 4:27,28; 5:38,39; Eph 1:11; Heb 6:17,18 1Pe 2:8; Jude 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-22","title":"Proverbs 19:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>desire. 1Ch 29:2,3,17; 2Ch 6:8; Mr 12:41-44; 14:6-8; 2Co 8:2,3,12 and. 1; Job 6:15; 17:5; Ps 62:9; Tit 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-23","title":"Proverbs 19:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>fear. 10:27; 14:26,27; Ps 19:9; 33:18,19; 34:9-11; 85:9; 103:17; 145:18-20 Mal 3:16,17; 4:2; Ac 9:31 shall abide. Ps 90:14; 91:16; Isa 58:10,11; Mt 5:6; Php 4:11,12; 1Ti 4:8; 6:6-9 Heb 13:5,6 he shall. 12:21; Ro 8:28; 2Ti 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-24","title":"Proverbs 19:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>15; 6:9,10; 12:27; 15:19; 24:30-34; 26:13-16; Ps 74:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-25","title":"Proverbs 19:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Smite. 21:11; De 13:11; 21:21 beware. Heb. be cunning. reprove. 9:9,10; 15:5; 17:10; Re 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-26","title":"Proverbs 19:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>wasteth. 10:1; 17:25; 23:22-25; 28:14; 30:11,17; De 21:18-21; Lu 15:12-16,30 a son. 10:5; 17:2; 28:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-27","title":"Proverbs 19:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>14:7; De 13:1-4; 1Ki 22:22-28; Mt 7:15; 16:6,12; Mr 4:24; 7:6-14 Joh 10:5; 2Co 11:13-15; Eph 4:14; 1Ti 4:7; 6:3-5; 2Pe 2:1,2 1Jo 4:1; 2Jo 1:10; Re 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-28","title":"Proverbs 19:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>An ungodly witness. Heb. a witness of Belial. 1Ki 21:10,13; Ac 6:11-13 scorneth. Ps 10:5,11; Isa 28:14-18; Lu 18:2-4 the. 15:14; Job 15:16; 20:12,13; 34:7; Ho 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-19-29","title":"Proverbs 19:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Judgments. 3:34; 9:12; Isa 28:22; 29:20; Ac 13:40,41; 2Pe 3:3-7 and. 7:22; 10:13; 17:10; 26:3; Heb 12:6</p>"}]}